    "overview": "Read how Islam and the caliphate spread, then explain why Arabic became a shared language of trade and learning.",
    "prompt": "Read \"A Faith and an Empire Spread.\" Explain two reasons Arabic became a shared language across lands from Spain to Central Asia, and explain how a shared language and shared rules made trade easier. Use at least one detail from the reading.",
    "resources": [
      "faith-and-empire"
    ],
    "subject": "history-social-studies",
    "template": "writing-task",
    "title": "A Faith and an Empire Spread"
  },
  "alignments": [
    {
      "competencyUri": "urn:educateos:catalog:c3:C3.D2.His.1.6-8",
