      "Diaz wrote partly to win credit and reward for ordinary soldiers. How might that purpose, and his memory as an old man, shape what he included?"
    ],
    "subject": "history-social-studies",
    "template": "primary-source-analysis",
    "title": "A Soldier Remembers Tenochtitlan"
  },
  "alignments": [
    {
