    "prompt": "Irrigation, writing, and written law all helped Mesopotamian cities grow and last. Which of the three did the most to make large cities possible? Write an argument with a clear claim, at least two pieces of evidence from the readings, an explanation of how each piece supports your claim, and a sentence that answers someone who would choose a different development.",
